          "fill": "$fg-subtle",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "2026-10-23 — Mirrored to code at fe094843 after a second ui-review and D174: measured weeks and \"Encendido desde\", a Total column, \"Esta sem.\", funnels led by counts, Apagado without funnels or capture, and the day counters moved here from Estado (Panorama per day, Descubrir).\n2026-10-23 — Mirrored to code at d168527d after ui-review: weeks newest first, funnels lead with this week, whole percentages, es-MX questions in place of internal ids, Apagado reads \"no se mide\" and dashes, Aperturas by screen name over one 14-day window, Descubrir as a closing line. The open finding on the hidden current week is closed.\n2026-10-23 — Created from flows/settings.pen's kit for the usage record (ADR-032, #901): Uso drawn as shipped, Apagado and Con datos. Sample figures in Con datos are illustrative.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
